{"id":"n58455-1-7","stage":3,"title":"버터 · 黄油","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58455-1-7-1","ko":"토스트가 좀 느끼한 것 같아.","zh":"吐司好像有点油腻啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"토스트가","meaning":"吐司，烤面包片","explanation":"토스트：吐司，烤面包片；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"토스트","audio":"/audio/c8d2b498711f4acb07bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80740","senseId":"1","lemma":"토스트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토스트가","audio":"/audio/14f8be5794445aa3b42b.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"느끼한","meaning":"油腻，甜腻","explanation":"느끼하다：油腻，甜腻；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"느끼하다","audio":"/audio/e1d77341c32cacddffff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40395","senseId":"1","lemma":"느끼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느끼한","audio":"/audio/ec2b72ca4dc1b3784edb.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c8d2b498711f4acb","term":"토스트","zh":"吐司，烤面包片","audio":"/audio/c8d2b498711f4acb07bd.mp3","entryId":"80740","definition":"切成薄片后用微火烤制而成的面包。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70a